], "size": [238.02723693847656, 178], "pos": [4436.2353515625, 3009.134033203125], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 89, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [141], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [4835.330078125, 2068.64794921875], "widgets_values": ["Qwen-Image-Edit_2511_fp8加速版.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "UNET名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "剪枝类型"}], "flags": {}, "id": 93, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [139], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [458.05426025390625, 471.6109619140625], "pos": [4782.8671875, 3282.274658203125], "widgets_values": ["# Role and Task\n你是一个极其严格的纯英文修图指令生成工具。你的唯一任务是：基于用户输入寻找目标产品，分析其在画面中的位置和外部容器材质，并严格将信息填入固定的纯英文模板公式中。\n\n# 绝对约束 (CRITICAL RULES)\n1. 必须100%输出纯英文提示词，严禁包含任何中文字符。\n2. 液体禁令：绝对禁止分析、描述或优化任何液体（liquid, serum, water, fluid, contents）。你只能针对产品的“外部固体容器/外壳”（如玻璃瓶身）进行材质和光影提升。\n3.描述产品时不得给产品增加定语(如 tilted)。\n\n# 材质专属优化字典（预设库）\n当你识别出产品外部的具体材质时，必须严格调用对应的英文描述：\n- 玻璃/水晶类材质 (Glass/Crystal): \"creating crisp, realistic reflections and subtle light refraction\"\n- 标签 (Label): \"The label is a matte paper surface. Increase the shadow area of the rendering label with a soft contrast to maintain the color continuity of the entire surface.\"\n- 磨砂/金属/通用材质 (Matte/Metal/General): \"displaying enhanced 8k product photography texture with hyper-realistic details\"\n\n# 纯英文输出模板\nEnhance the [Material] texture of the [Position] [Product], [Specific Texture Description], improve its lighting, and make it perfectly blend into the environment.\n\n# 结尾锁定声明（固定不变）\nKeep all other backgrounds and content strictly unchanged without any modifications.\n\n# 工作执行逻辑\n1. 寻找目标：锁定用户对话中指定的[Product]（自动将其翻译为恰当的英文单词，如 cosmetic bottle, jar 等，严禁用 serum/liquid 代指产品）。\n2. 分析替换：识别产品的[Position]（如 left, center, right）和外部[Material]（如 glass）。查阅“字典”，获取对应的[Specific Texture Description]。\n3. 填入模板：将上述纯英文信息无缝替换到方括号中，生成完整的英文句子。如果用户指定了多个物品，请连续输出多句模板。\n4. 拼接结尾：在所有模板句子输出完毕后，立刻跟上“结尾锁定声明”。\n5. 严禁废话：只输出拼接好的纯英文段落，禁止输出分析过程或任何额外符号。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 43, "type": "JjkText", "title": "4", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI-Jjk-Nodes", "ver": "b3c99bb78a99551776b5eab1a820e1cd58f84f31", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [396.9327087402344, 444.95074462890625], "pos": [5305.037109375, 3598.682861328125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 140, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 91, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [270, 270], "pos": [10444.2568359375, 2531.51953125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 142, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 94, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 37}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape":